/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Official Website</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">1. MPPSC Assistant Professor Recruitment 2025 Re Open Online Form Start Date?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong>25 May&nbsp; 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>2. MPPSC Assistant Professor Exam Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Examination will be conducted in <strong>12 July 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>3. Where can I find the syllabus for the MPPSC Assistant Professor Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the MPPSC Assistant Professor Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>4. Madhya Pradesh MPPSC Assistant Professor Re Open Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>5. MPPSC Assistant Professor 2026 Recruitment Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>26 June 2026..</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Pay application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">26 June 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>7. How can I apply for MPPSC Assistant Professor 2025-2026 Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_23030\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-23030\" style=\"width: 1490px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23030\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201500%20993'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"MPPSC Assistant Professor 2026\" width=\"1500\" height=\"993\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026.jpg 1500w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026-300x199.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026-768x508.jpg 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026.jpg\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23030\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026.jpg\" alt=\"MPPSC Assistant Professor 2026\" width=\"1500\" height=\"993\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026.jpg 1500w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026-300x199.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/MPPSC-Assistant-Professor-2026-768x508.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" /></noscript><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-23030\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">MPPSC Assistant Professor 2026</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Main Pajes 2 -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
